    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Nexus Flow of Time&quot; turn-based system: </h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201710/extras/7f3659375838f47796b4e7705a49dd99.avif?t=1745483158\" width=608 height=311 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tactical Phase : time is stopped, <strong>Plan</strong> your actions with precision<br></li><li> Unleash Phase:\u00a0 <strong>Watch</strong> your and the ennemies actions unfold simultaneously</li></ul><br><i>&quot;Say goodbye to waiting your turn! Experience the thrill of simultaneous strategy.&quot;</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Foresight system:</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201710/extras/90a70333830bc58c48df86e852fc010d.poster.avif?t=1745483158\" width=630 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201710/extras/90a70333830bc58c48df86e852fc010d.webm?t=1745483158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> the Nexus grants you a unique ability by revealing the actions your enemies intend to take<br></li><li> plan and <strong>counter your opponent\u2019s strategy</strong>, emphasizing skill over luck</li></ul><br><i>&quot;No more unpredictable AI. Outsmart your opponent with strategic foresight!&quot;</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201710/extras/023aeae8b8ebd7f2e356ac77d6c1af1c.webp?t=1745483158\" width=447 height=29 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast Character Progression:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> you\u2019ll discover powerful artefacts created by the Nexus<br></li><li> <strong>characters evolve quickly</strong>, unlocked powerful abilities</li></ul><br><i>&quot;Why wait to level up? Rapid progression lets you build your dream team faster!&quot;</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201710/extras/023aeae8b8ebd7f2e356ac77d6c1af1c.webp?t=1745483158\" width=447 height=29 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dungeon Crawler Experience:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> use Arcane Portals between worlds in a bid to dominate them all<br></li><li> exploring <strong>vast, interconnected dungeons</strong></li></ul><br><i>&quot;Explore vast dungeons, not just tiny maps. Dive deep into a world of endless adventure!&quot;</i>",
